+ *
+ * encodeURI does not encode the following characters:
+ * A-Z a-z 0-9 ; , / ? : @ & = + $ - _ . ! ~ * ' ( ) # space
+ *
+ * Comparing these, the characters that encodeURI does not encode AND are NOT attr-char are:
+ *   space ( ) , ; = @ ? / : * '
  */
 
